sequenceDiagram
  actor C as Customer
  participant UI as Checkout page
  participant API as POST /api/orders
  participant GW as Payment gateway adapter
  participant PG as PostgreSQL (role customer)
  participant TR as Triggers
  participant ML as Mailer

  C->>UI: choose address, enter card, press Place order
  UI->>API: JSON {addressId, paymentMethod, card}
  API->>API: CSRF guard, session cookie, role = customer
  API->>PG: BEGIN, SET LOCAL ROLE bookstore_customer, fn_cart_totals()
  PG-->>API: total_cents
  API->>GW: charge(card, total)
  alt card declined or invalid
    GW-->>API: error 402 or 400
    API-->>UI: Payment declined (cart and stock untouched)
  else approved
    GW-->>API: reference + "Card ending 4242"
    API->>PG: CALL sp_place_order(address, method, reference, label)
    PG->>PG: lock book rows FOR UPDATE, check stock
    PG->>TR: insert order, items, payment, delete cart
    TR->>TR: deduct stock, stock ledger, order notification, low-stock alert
    alt procedure fails (e.g. last copy gone)
      PG-->>API: error, whole transaction rolled back
      API->>GW: refund(reference)
      API-->>UI: friendly message
    else committed
      PG-->>API: order id
      API-->>UI: 200 order number
      API-)ML: flushOutbox() after response
      ML->>PG: fn_pending_emails()
      ML->>ML: send confirmation e-mail
      ML->>PG: fn_mark_email(id, sent)
    end
  end
